# libnfs corresponding source and relinking

mongoose @VERSION@ statically links libnfs from:

- Repository: <@LIBNFS_URL@>
- Exact revision: `@LIBNFS_SHA@`
- Archive in this release: `libnfs-@LIBNFS_SHORT_SHA@-source.tar.gz`
- Linkage: static (`libnfs.a`)
- Archive digest used for the official binary: `@LIBNFS_STATIC_SHA@`

The same release provides `mongoose-@VERSION@-source.tar.gz` and
`mongoose-@VERSION@-relink-kit.tar.gz`. The relink kit contains mongoose,
libnfs, the pinned nfs-walker source, vendored Rust dependencies, the exact
toolchain/build settings, and an executable verification script. It can be
used offline to modify libnfs and relink a replacement mongoose executable.

Release location:
<https://github.com/blakegolliher/mongoose/releases/tag/v@VERSION@>

There is no restriction on reverse engineering mongoose for the purpose of
debugging modifications to libnfs. See `RELINKING.md` inside the relink kit.
